{"id":"baby-s-breath","name":"Baby's Breath","type":"character","aliases":[],"description":"A faerie of the Deffroad Clique in a gown of baby's breath who taunts Morecote and helps poison Sigric.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2026-01-07","last_seen":"2026-01-07","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths","series":"Magic Story","authors":["K. Arsenault Rivera"],"date":"2026-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths\" by K. Arsenault Rivera. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Jan 2026."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths-e2","summary":"Three faeries taunt Morecote, calling him a failure, and challenge him to a duel.","participants":["morecote","forget-me-not","baby-s-breath","meadowsweet","erewaker"],"location":"lorwyn","importance":"minor","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","order":614,"story_date":"2026-01-07","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"If you duel all of us at once and win, we'll tell you something.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths#:~:text=If%20you%20duel%20all,we%27ll%20tell%20you%20something.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths","series":"Magic Story","authors":["K. Arsenault Rivera"],"date":"2026-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths#:~:text=If%20you%20duel%20all,we%27ll%20tell%20you%20something