":["K. Arsenault Rivera"],"date":"2026-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths#:~:text=Once%20she%20walks%20round%20the%20clearing.%20Twice.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths\" by K. Arsenault Rivera. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths-e15","summary":"The ritual seems to fail, and the faeries urge Erewaker to cast aside her relic.","participants":["erewaker","forget-me-not","baby-s-breath","crescent-relic"],"location":"shadowmoor","importance":"major","page":"stories/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","order":614,"story_date":"2026-01-07","storyline":"Lorwyn Eclipsed","source":"wizards","paragraph":192,"quote":"Is cast aside your relic.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths#:~:text=Is%20cast%20aside%20your%20relic.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths","series":"Magic Story","authors":["K. Arsenault Rivera"],"date":"2026-01-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths#:~:text=Is%20cast%20aside%20your%20relic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Lorwyn Eclipsed | Three Dreams, Three Truths\" by K. Arsenault Rivera. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Jan 2026."}},{"id":"lorwyn-eclipsed-three-dreams-three-truths-e17","summary":"The faeries attack the relic and sapling, and an explosion of magic covers the clearing in dawnglove.","participants":["forget-me-not","baby-s-breath","yew-sapling","crescent-relic","dawnglove"],"location":"shadowmoor","importance":"major","page":"stories/